@host = http://localhost:7071

# Endpoints are AuthorizationLevel.Function. The local Core Tools host does not enforce
# keys, so these requests work as-is against localhost.
#
# Deployed, callers go through APIM instead of hitting the function app directly. APIM
# validates the Entra token and injects x-functions-key for the backend. To test through
# the gateway, point @host at https://<apim>.azure-api.net/geo and send @token:
#   az account get-access-token --resource api://<apim-client-id> --query accessToken -o tsv
@token = paste-a-bearer-token-here-when-testing-through-apim

GET {{host}}/api/map?city=Seattle&width=640&height=480&zoom=10&mapType=satellite

### Geocode a place name or address into candidate coordinates

GET {{host}}/api/geocode?query=Boise, Idaho&top=3

### Ambiguous place name, expect several candidates

GET {{host}}/api/geocode?query=Springfield&countryRegion=US&top=5

###

GET {{host}}/api/map?latitude=47.6062&longitude=-122.3321

###

GET {{host}}/api/map?latitude=47.6062&longitude=-122.3321&mapType=satellite&radiusMeters=250

### Map image returned as a temporary SAS link instead of PNG bytes

GET {{host}}/api/map?latitude=47.6062&longitude=-122.3321&radiusMeters=500&output=url

###

POST {{host}}/api/map
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "city": "London",
  "width": 800,
  "height": 600,
  "zoom": 11,
  "mapType": "dark"
}

###

POST {{host}}/api/map
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 35.6762,
  "longitude": 139.6503
}

###

GET {{host}}/api/route?originLatitude=47.6062&originLongitude=-122.3321&destinationLatitude=47.4502&destinationLongitude=-122.3088&travelMode=truck&zoom=12

###

POST {{host}}/api/route
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originLatitude": 47.6062,
  "originLongitude": -122.3321,
  "destinationLatitude": 47.4502,
  "destinationLongitude": -122.3088,
  "travelMode": "truck",
  "zoom": 12,
  "vehicleSpec": {
    "axleCount": 5,
    "isVehicleCommercial": true
  }
}

### Partial truck profile using GET

GET {{host}}/api/route?originLatitude=47.6062&originLongitude=-122.3321&destinationLatitude=47.4502&destinationLongitude=-122.3088&travelMode=truck&axleCount=5&isVehicleCommercial=true

### Truck route details as GeoJSON

GET {{host}}/api/route?originLatitude=47.6062&originLongitude=-122.3321&destinationLatitude=47.4502&destinationLongitude=-122.3088&travelMode=truck&axleCount=5&isVehicleCommercial=true&output=details

### Route map returned as a temporary SAS link instead of PNG bytes

GET {{host}}/api/route?originLatitude=47.6062&originLongitude=-122.3321&destinationLatitude=47.4502&destinationLongitude=-122.3088&output=url

### Reverse geocode a point

GET {{host}}/api/geocode/reverse?latitude=47.6062&longitude=-122.3321

### Traffic incidents near a point

GET {{host}}/api/traffic/incidents?latitude=47.6062&longitude=-122.3321&radiusMeters=2000

### Current weather conditions at a point

GET {{host}}/api/weather/conditions?latitude=47.6062&longitude=-122.3321

### Azure Maps severe weather alerts at a point

GET {{host}}/api/weather/alerts?latitude=47.6062&longitude=-122.3321

### National Weather Service active alerts at a point

GET {{host}}/api/alerts/nws?latitude=47.6062&longitude=-122.3321

### Terrain elevation and slope around a point

GET {{host}}/api/elevation?latitude=47.6062&longitude=-122.3321&radiusMeters=100

### Outside NWS coverage returns a clear no-coverage response

GET {{host}}/api/alerts/nws?latitude=51.5072&longitude=-0.1276